t the unique coolness of Northern Europe. Outfit is minimalist and modern, background is blurred in cool tones. Needs to perfectly capture the characteristics of a Scandinavian woman. solo, Centered composition\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 74, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 45, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.47", "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [63], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [200, 30], "pos": [291.5088195800781, 329.6298828125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 66, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 42, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.40", "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [72], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [385.9152526855469, 256.756103515625], "pos": [-316.8390197753906, 715.3751220703125], "widgets_values": ["优雅闲适明亮客厅： 开阔空间，浅色调墙壁与天花板，营造温馨大气氛围。核心视觉：造型独特的木质吊扇与线条感吊顶和谐呼应。\n\n家具与软装： 深色柚木/胡桃木框架家具，搭配蓝白条纹/印花布艺软装（沙发、单椅），沉稳与清新平衡。沙发点缀柔软亚麻抱枕与编织纹理毛毯，传递舒适感。\n\n细节亮点：\n茶几陈设： 青花瓷瓶插白色蝴蝶兰，旁置翻开的精装书籍与黄铜边框台灯（散发暖光）。\n窗景区域：大型落地窗配透光纱帘，自然光倾洒形成灵动光影。窗边柚木长凳摆放茂盛琴叶榕/龟背竹。\n\n空间延伸：无缝连接开放式厨房。可见简约造型吊灯、白色哑光烤漆橱柜、浅色大理石台面，精致实用。\n\n整体风格：现代简约融合自然元素，强调优雅、闲适与明亮。柔和光影、天然材质（木、棉麻、陶瓷）、绿植点缀。高清摄影，自然光效，超写实细节（木纹、织物纹理、陶瓷光泽、叶片脉络）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [